  "body": "There's at least two places in the spec that contain strings that are not \"m.\"-prefixed:\n- Federation query names\n- Profile keys\n\nWe might want to consider if either of these are likely to be sufficiently extensible that we should namespace them, to allow 3rd-party extensions to play nicely.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SPEC-44)\n\n(Reported by @leonerd)\n",
